*.log
*.pyc
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
.scheduler-autocommit.log
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
# Per-agent isolated worktree checkouts the harness creates under this repo
# for parallel batch runs (each a full copy of the tree, not source of its
# own) -- concurrent jobs are actively writing here; committing or deleting
# them would clobber another job's in-flight work.
.claude/worktrees/
# Session transcripts carry the Anthropic OAuth token verbatim -- one was found
# in /home/crt/.claude/projects/ on monkey. This repo tracks other .claude/
# files, so without these two lines an autocommit publishes a live credential.
.claude/projects/
*.jsonl

# Secrets -- real credentials never live in a tracked file; keep them in an
# untracked .env / secrets/ instead (see DEV-DISCIPLINE-RETROSPECTIVE §5).
*_creds.json
*credentials*
*secret*
!SECRETARY.md
!.selfdev-secrets
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
.env

# Build/flash debris -- disk images and firmware are not source.
*.img
*.img.xz
*.img.gz
*.iso
*.efi
*.EFI
*.dmg

# Exploratory/one-off artifacts, not source (2026-07-24 build-discipline
# pass, flagged by realisateur's /ideate 2026-07-24 dirty-tree finding).
potato_large.txt

# The sidecar lock bin/crt_fixups_store.py takes while it rewrites
# stt-fixups.json, and the per-process temp that write goes through. Both
# are transient; neither is source.
*.json.lock
*.tmp
